{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411310","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411310","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1241131001:1":{"text":"Do you know what Greenbrook used to be like?","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241131001":{"text":"Do you know what Greenbrook used to be like?","source_cn":"你们知道，之前的绿水村是什么样的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE542ACF611CA3BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241131002:1":{"text":"Greenbrook used to be very prosperous.","source_cn":"之前的绿水村是非常富饶的村庄。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11EA49B7F97CE63F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241131003:1":{"text":"The waters here were very clear and full of a fish known as <style=\"highlight\">silverwave fish</style>.","source_cn":"这里的海域水很清澈，盛产一种叫<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x107118EEAB118842","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241131004:1":{"text":"This fish, known for its great taste, ability to withstand long journeys, and high yield, was exported from Rustport to many places.","source_cn":"这种鱼因为味美，耐长途运输，产量大，被从锈锚港销往很多地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD349CDFFC9DBB29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241131005:1":{"text":"Back then, ships loaded with fish would depart from Rustport and come back with spices, fabrics, and various seeds from faraway places.","source_cn":"那时候，一艘又一艘装着鱼获的船驶出锈锚港，返航时则带回...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB816FB93E446A09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241131006:1":{"text":"Hard to believe Rustport used to be such a bustling place when it's so deserted now...","source_cn":"原来锈锚港以前这么繁荣，但现在港口冷清得连个人都没有……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30FA4705EFF3AD50","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241131007:1":{"text":"Now, the village is a far cry from its former glory...","source_cn":"现在这个村子让人完全联想不到富饶……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2C51B34299C839A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1241131008:1":{"text":"When the rumor of this place being haunted came out, I sent my people here to investigate, but it was to no avail.","source_cn":"这里传出闹鬼的传闻后，我派人来这里探查过，但一无所获。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BE7C329D5B3B424","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1241131009:1":{"text":"Those I sent here never even returned.","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1241131009":{"text":"Those I sent here never even returned.","source_cn":"甚至我派的人，都没有回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA39CC6DD640D1EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241131010:1":{"text":"A drunk fisherman claimed to hear screams and see ghostly shadows in the fog.","source_cn":"一个喝醉的渔民说的，说雾气里有尖声怪叫，鬼影幢幢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC90E4D21DFBE5EDE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241131011:1":{"text":"The fisherman went mad after the sighting, so many believed what he said.","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241131011":{"text":"The fisherman went mad after the sighting, so many believed what he said.","source_cn":"他声称撞见幽灵，然后就疯了，因此很多人都相信他说的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0715C92BBF5ECA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241131012:1":{"text":"Even if they were, I'm sure they were trying to warn us.","source_cn":"即使有，那些幽灵传出的讯息也应该是警示。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0169F3DD4A7E3593","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241131013:1":{"text":"I think the ghosts were trying to warn the people to <style=\"highlight\">stay away from the danger.</style>","source_cn":"我想，他们应该是在警示：<style=highligh...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAAA75A8643975928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241131014:1":{"text":"So, I took advantage of the rumor and spread the word to the villagers to avoid coming to Rustport.","source_cn":"借闹鬼的传闻，我放出消息，让普通居民尽量不要靠近这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0468C052278B5AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241131015:1":{"text":"S—Sir Chippy will take out whatever monsters that come our way!","source_cn":"不、不管碰到什么，骑士满满都会打倒它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCBBE7EB199FCC321","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241131016:1":{"text":"Well, you'd sound more convincing if your hands weren't trembling!","source_cn":"如果满满说这话的时候手不抖，就更有气势了哦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5FA3D10AFE49B6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:0:1":{"text":"Those shadows...","source_cn":"那些鬼影……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3A2F288C6D2201F2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Those shadows...","female":"Those shadows...","variant_male_record_index":"66558","variant_female_record_index":"66559","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:16:1:2":{"text":"Were there really ghosts?","source_cn":"真有鬼吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAFA014814171576E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Were there really ghosts?","female":"Were there really ghosts?","variant_male_record_index":"66560","variant_female_record_index":"66561","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:0:1":{"text":"Haunted?","source_cn":"闹鬼的传闻？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBDA8EBF505D5CAED","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Haunted?","female":"Haunted?","variant_male_record_index":"66554","variant_female_record_index":"66555","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:13:1:2":{"text":"Who said that?","source_cn":"谁说闹鬼？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB36C4D9CF0D33F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Who said that?","female":"Who said that?","variant_male_record_index":"66556","variant_female_record_index":"66557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","documen